    "title": "Michelle Branch teams with Maren Morris to reimagine 'Goodbye to You' - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Buddy Iahn ,\n1 days ago The clip features Kristen Cavallari in a Laguna Beach-themed video. In a massive collaboration of two Grammy-winning artists, Michelle Branch and Maren Morris have come together on a newly reimagined version of “Goodbye to You,” out now via BMG. The release arrives alongside an official music video starring Branch, Morris and Kristin Cavallari, which revisits iconic moments from Laguna Beach in an iconic music video set to break the internet. Read full article",
